### Add Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sugar",
    "category": "Grocery",
    "price": 50,
    "quantity": 10,
    "image": "sugar.jpg"
}

### Get All Products

GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

